      "responsibility": "Register and maintain users with personal and contractual data (department, category, access profile, employment agreement), manage password lifecycle, and handle the full vacation-request lifecycle including state control, business-day balance calculation, proportional entitlement, and approver notifications. Evidence: RF-04, RF-05, RF-06, RF-08 through RF-14, pkg com.autentia.tnt.manager.admin.",
